# END OF .gitignore
# ===================
#
# Security Reminders:
# - Never commit real API keys or secrets
# - Use environment variables for sensitive data
# - Add files with PII to .gitignore immediately
# - Regularly scan for accidentally committed secrets
# - Use pre-commit hooks to catch issues early
#
# For questions about what should be ignored:
# - When in doubt, add it to .gitignore
# - Better to over-exclude than accidentally expose sensitive data
# - Review this file regularly and update as needed

# --- EQ12 GIT HYGIENE AUTOMATION ---
